is humanoid mobile weapon Chamber are swallowed up into a distortion of time and space. Waking from his artificially induced hibernation, Ledo realizes that he has arrived on Earth, the planet on the lost frontier. On this planet that was completely flooded by the seas, people live in fleets of giant ships, salvaging relics from the seas' depths in order to survive. Ledo arrives on one of the fleets called Gargantia. With no knowledge of the planet's history or culture, he is forced to live alongside Amy, a 15-year-old girl who serves as a messenger aboard the Gargantia fleet. To Ledo, who has lived a life where he knows nothing but fighting, these days of peace continue to surprise him.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Environmental","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Lost Civilization","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ships","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Language Barrier","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Pirates","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Robot","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Cult","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Revenge","rank":30,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Gargantia on the Verdurous Planet","english":"Gargantia on the Verdurous Planet","native":"翠星のガルガンティア","romaji":"Suisei no Gargantia","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","va